{
  "id": "RAW_8366f8e4e8",
  "title": "5 种新方式提升谷歌搜索中的学习体验",
  "url": "https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/search/back-to-school-study-tools/",
  "date": "2026-08-20 03:00:01",
  "author": "Awaneesh Verma",
  "siteName": "The Keyword (blog.google) ",
  "content": "<!--article text-->\n<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-article-paragraph\" data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Paragraph&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;5 new ways to level up your learning with Search&quot;\n  }\">\n   <uni-article-paragraph class=\"uni-article-paragraph__container uni-grid__col--layout-6\">\n    <div class=\"rich-text\">\n     <p data-block-key=\"tn5vb\">A new school year is the ultimate chance to upgrade your routine — whether you’re navigating tough new subjects, prepping for exams, or trying to stay organized across your classes. Having the right tools makes all the difference.</p>\n     <p data-block-key=\"11ga4\">To help you start the semester with confidence, we’re introducing new ways to level up your learning through AI in Search, with education tools that are built to be safe by design.</p>\n     <h2 data-block-key=\"9969s\">1. Understand concepts with interactive visuals.</h2>\n     <p data-block-key=\"62cmk\">Sometimes, reading a static textbook page isn't enough to make a concept click. Search can now generate custom tools and simulations to help you see complex topics in action. Let's say you're learning about pH levels. You can do a search like \"ph scale\" and quickly get an interactive visual in an AI Overview to help you understand the basics.</p>\n     <p data-block-key=\"ak6t3\">To go even further, you can follow up and ask to see something more specialized, like plotting citrus fruits on the pH scale, and <a href=\"http://g.ai/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">AI Mode</a> will create a customized experience just for your question. Or, if you already have a hyper-specific question in mind, head straight to AI Mode and describe the tool or visual you need. Generative UI capabilities have launched globally in English in AI Mode and have started rolling out as well in AI Overviews.</p>\n    </div>\n    <!---->\n   </uni-article-paragraph>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page--fullbleed uni-media-carousel-wrapper\" data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Media Carousel&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;5 new ways to level up your learning with Search&quot;\n  }\">\n   <uni-media-carousel class=\"uni-media-carousel uni-page uni-grid\" data-shape-context-provider=\"\">\n    <!---->\n    <div class=\"uni-carousel\" role=\"region\" aria-roledescription=\"carousel\" aria-label=\"Carousel\">\n     <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n     <uni-media-carousel-viewport slot=\"viewport\" class=\"uni-media-carousel__viewport\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"display: block;\">\n      <!---->\n      <div class=\"uni-scrollable-cards-panel-viewport\">\n       <div class=\"uni-scrollable-cards-panel-viewport__container\" role=\"list\" style=\"inset-inline-start: -524.5px; padding-inline: 524.5px 319.5px; scroll-padding-inline: 524.5px 319.5px;\">\n        <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n        <!---->\n        <div class=\"uni-scrollable-cards-panel-viewport__slide\" role=\"listitem\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\">\n         <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n         <uni-media-carousel-slide class=\"uni-media-carousel__slide\" data-theme=\"aquamarine\" shapes=\"[&quot;8-leaf-clover&quot;, &quot;ghost-ish&quot;, &quot;square&quot;]\" data-index=\"0\" accordion-header=\"\">\n          <!---->\n          <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n          <div class=\"uni-media-carousel__content\">\n           <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n           <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n           <div slot=\"content\" style=\"display: block;\">\n            <uni-media data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Media Carousel/Video&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;5 new ways to level up your learning with Search&quot;\n  }\" or-mp4-video-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/AIM_GenUI_pH_1920x1080.mp4\" section-header=\"5 new ways to level up your learning with Search\" alt-text=\"Learning about the pH scale in AI Mode\" video-title=\"pH scale\" autoplay=\"true\">\n             <!---->\n             <div class=\"uni-media\">\n              <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n              <div class=\" uni-media__asset uni-media__asset--mp4 \">\n               <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n               <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n               <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n               <uni-video-player autoplay-override=\"\" muted playsinline=\"\" controls=\"\" type=\"video/mp4\" alt-text=\"Learning about the pH scale in AI Mode\" autoplay=\"\" video-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/AIM_GenUI_pH_1920x1080.mp4\" tts-json=\"[]\" audio-descripted-video=\"\" section-header=\"5 new ways to level up your learning with Search\" video-title=\"pH scale\">\n                <!---->\n                <div class=\"uni-video-player\">\n                 <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n                 <video crossorigin=\"anonymous\" preload=\"auto\" muted playsinline=\"\" aria-label=\"Learning about the pH scale in AI Mode\" class=\" uni-video-player__video uni-video-player__video--autoplay \" title=\"pH scale\" style=\"min-height:0px;\" poster=\"\">\n                  <source type=\"video/mp4\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/AIM_GenUI_pH_1920x1080.mp4#t=0.001\">Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos, but don't worry, you can <a download=\"\" href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/AIM_GenUI_pH_1920x1080.mp4\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">download it</a> and watch it with your favorite video player!\n                 </video>\n                 <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n                </div>\n               </uni-video-player>\n               <!--?-->\n              </div>\n             </div>\n            </uni-media>\n           </div>\n          </div>\n          <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n          <!--?-->\n         </uni-media-carousel-slide>\n        </div>\n        <!---->\n        <!---->\n        <div class=\"uni-scrollable-cards-panel-viewport__slide\" role=\"listitem\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\">\n         <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n         <uni-media-carousel-slide class=\"uni-media-carousel__slide\" data-theme=\"aquamarine\" shapes=\"[&quot;8-leaf-clover&quot;, &quot;ghost-ish&quot;, &quot;square&quot;]\" data-index=\"1\" accordion-header=\"\">\n          <!---->\n          <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n          <div class=\"uni-media-carousel__content\">\n           <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n           <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n           <div slot=\"content\" style=\"display: block;\">\n            <uni-media data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Media Carousel/Video&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;5 new ways to level up your learning with Search&quot;\n  }\" or-mp4-video-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/Google_Search_Science_Queries_Atoms_16x9_v03.mp4\" section-header=\"5 new ways to level up your learning with Search\" alt-text=\"Asking Gemini to create a 3D visual\" video-title=\"Queries Atoms\" autoplay=\"true\">\n             <!---->\n             <div class=\"uni-media\">\n              <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n              <div class=\" uni-media__asset uni-media__asset--mp4 \">\n               <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n               <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n               <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n               <uni-video-player autoplay-override=\"\" muted playsinline=\"\" controls=\"\" type=\"video/mp4\" alt-text=\"Asking Gemini to create a 3D visual\" autoplay=\"\" video-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/Google_Search_Science_Queries_Atoms_16x9_v03.mp4\" tts-json=\"[]\" audio-descripted-video=\"\" section-header=\"5 new ways to level up your learning with Search\" video-title=\"Queries Atoms\">\n                <!---->\n                <div class=\"uni-video-player\">\n                 <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n                 <video crossorigin=\"anonymous\" preload=\"auto\" muted playsinline=\"\" aria-label=\"Asking Gemini to create a 3D visual\" class=\" uni-video-player__video uni-video-player__video--autoplay \" title=\"Queries Atoms\" style=\"min-height:0px;\" poster=\"\">\n                  <source type=\"video/mp4\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/Google_Search_Science_Queries_Atoms_16x9_v03.mp4#t=0.001\">Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos, but don't worry, you can <a download=\"\" href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/Google_Search_Science_Queries_Atoms_16x9_v03.mp4\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">download it</a> and watch it with your favorite video player!\n                 </video>\n                 <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n                </div>\n               </uni-video-player>\n               <!--?-->\n              </div>\n             </div>\n            </uni-media>\n           </div>\n          </div>\n          <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n          <!--?-->\n         </uni-media-carousel-slide>\n        </div>\n        <!---->\n        <!---->\n        <div class=\"uni-scrollable-cards-panel-viewport__slide\" role=\"listitem\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\">\n         <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n         <uni-media-carousel-slide class=\"uni-media-carousel__slide\" data-theme=\"aquamarine\" shapes=\"[&quot;8-leaf-clover&quot;, &quot;ghost-ish&quot;, &quot;square&quot;]\" data-index=\"2\" accordion-header=\"\">\n          <!---->\n          <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n          <div class=\"uni-media-carousel__content\">\n           <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n           <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n           <div slot=\"content\" style=\"display: block;\">\n            <uni-media data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Media Carousel/Video&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;5 new ways to level up your learning with Search&quot;\n  }\" or-mp4-video-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/Google_Search_Science_Queries_GenUI_Periodic_Table_16x9_v01.mp4\" section-header=\"5 new ways to level up your learning with Search\" alt-text=\"AI generated visual of chemical reactions\" video-title=\"Periodic Table\" autoplay=\"true\">\n             <!---->\n             <div class=\"uni-media\">\n              <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n              <div class=\" uni-media__asset uni-media__asset--mp4 \">\n               <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n               <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n               <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n               <uni-video-player autoplay-override=\"\" muted playsinline=\"\" controls=\"\" type=\"video/mp4\" alt-text=\"AI generated visual of chemical reactions\" autoplay=\"\" video-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/Google_Search_Science_Queries_GenUI_Periodic_Table_16x9_v01.mp4\" tts-json=\"[]\" audio-descripted-video=\"\" section-header=\"5 new ways to level up your learning with Search\" video-title=\"Periodic Table\">\n                <!---->\n                <div class=\"uni-video-player\">\n                 <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n                 <video crossorigin=\"anonymous\" preload=\"auto\" muted playsinline=\"\" aria-label=\"AI generated visual of chemical reactions\" class=\" uni-video-player__video uni-video-player__video--autoplay \" title=\"Periodic Table\" style=\"min-height:0px;\" poster=\"\">\n                  <source type=\"video/mp4\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/Google_Search_Science_Queries_GenUI_Periodic_Table_16x9_v01.mp4#t=0.001\">Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos, but don't worry, you can <a download=\"\" href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/Google_Search_Science_Queries_GenUI_Periodic_Table_16x9_v01.mp4\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">download it</a> and watch it with your favorite video player!\n                 </video>\n                 <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n                </div>\n               </uni-video-player>\n               <!--?-->\n              </div>\n             </div>\n            </uni-media>\n           </div>\n          </div>\n          <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n          <!--?-->\n         </uni-media-carousel-slide>\n        </div>\n        <!---->\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </uni-media-carousel-viewport>\n     <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n     <div slot=\"controls\" style=\"display: block;\">\n      <div class=\"uni-media-carousel__controls-container\">\n       <uni-carousel-controls class=\"uni-media-carousel__controls\">\n        <!---->\n        <div class=\"uni-carousel-controls\">\n         <div class=\"uni-carousel-controls__arrows\">\n          <button class=\"uni-carousel-controls__btn uni-carousel-controls__btn--prev\" aria-label=\"Previous item\" disabled>\n           <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n            <path d=\"M15.41 16.59L10.83 12L15.41 7.41L14 6L8 12L14 18L15.41 16.59Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path>\n           </svg>\n          </button>\n          <button class=\"uni-carousel-controls__btn uni-carousel-controls__btn--next\" aria-label=\"Next item\">\n           <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n            <path d=\"M8.59 16.59L13.17 12L8.59 7.41L10 6L16 12L10 18L8.59 16.59Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path>\n           </svg>\n          </button>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"uni-carousel-controls__progress-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"uni-carousel-controls__progress-bar\"></div>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </uni-carousel-controls>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </uni-media-carousel>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-article-paragraph\" data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Paragraph&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;5 new ways to level up your learning with Search&quot;\n  }\">\n   <uni-article-paragraph class=\"uni-article-paragraph__container uni-grid__col--layout-6\">\n    <div class=\"rich-text\">\n     <h2 data-block-key=\"tn5vb\">2. Test your knowledge with practice quizzes.</h2>\n     <p data-block-key=\"bp3k0\">Want to make sure you actually retain what you studied? You can now get customized practice quizzes directly in Search for any subject, from science and math to humanities, foreign languages and more. You can also ask for a quiz to help you prep for the following standardized tests: ACT, AP, ENEM, GRE, JEE, LSAT, MCAT, NEET, and SAT. Thanks to our partnership with leading education companies The Princeton Review, Careers360, PhysicsWallah, and Akira Enem, these quizzes tap into trusted, authoritative content from test-prep experts, so you know you’re studying material that’s relevant to the exam.</p>\n    </div>\n    <!---->\n   </uni-article-paragraph>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-inline-image-section\" data-component=\"uni-inline-image\">\n   <uni-inline-image class=\"uni-inline-image uni-inline-image--full\" alignment=\"full\" alt-text=\"Asking Gemini to create a quiz for common vocab words in the SAT\" external-image=\"\" or-mp4-video-title=\"Quiz SAT\" or-mp4-video-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/InLineQuizSAT.mp4\" section-header=\"5 new ways to level up your learning with Search\" autoplay=\"true\">\n    <!---->\n    <div class=\"uni-inline-image__container uni-inline-image__container--full \" data-analytics-module=\"{&quot;module_name&quot;:&quot;Inline Images&quot;,&quot;section_header&quot;:&quot;5 new ways to level up your learning with Search&quot;}\">\n     <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n     <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n     <div class=\" uni-inline-image__media-asset uni-inline-image__media-asset--mp4 \">\n      <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n      <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n      <uni-video-player muted playsinline=\"\" controls=\"\" type=\"video/mp4\" alt-text=\"Asking Gemini to create a quiz for common vocab words in the SAT\" autoplay=\"\" video-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/InLineQuizSAT.mp4\" tts-json=\"\" audio-descripted-video=\"\" section-header=\"5 new ways to level up your learning with Search\" video-title=\"Quiz SAT\">\n       <!---->\n       <div class=\"uni-video-player\">\n        <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n        <video crossorigin=\"anonymous\" preload=\"auto\" muted playsinline=\"\" aria-label=\"Asking Gemini to create a quiz for common vocab words in the SAT\" class=\" uni-video-player__video uni-video-player__video--autoplay \" title=\"Quiz SAT\" style=\"min-height:0px;\" autoplay=\"\" loop=\"\" poster=\"\">\n         <source type=\"video/mp4\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/InLineQuizSAT.mp4#t=0.001\">Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos, but don't worry, you can <a download=\"\" href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/InLineQuizSAT.mp4\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">download it</a> and watch it with your favorite video player!\n        </video>\n        <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n       </div>\n      </uni-video-player>\n      <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n      <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n      <!--?-->\n      <!--?-->\n      <!--?-->\n     </div>\n     <!--?-->\n     <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n    </div>\n   </uni-inline-image>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-article-paragraph\" data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Paragraph&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;5 new ways to level up your learning with Search&quot;\n  }\">\n   <uni-article-paragraph class=\"uni-article-paragraph__container uni-grid__col--layout-6\">\n    <div class=\"rich-text\">\n     <p data-block-key=\"tn5vb\">Just search for something like “create a quiz with the most commonly tested vocab words to help me prep for the SAT.” Search will give you an interactive quiz that includes explanations for each response and links to learn more, so you can truly master the material. Practice quizzes are now globally available in English free of charge, in both AI Overviews and AI Mode.</p>\n     <h2 data-block-key=\"218lb\">3. Learn each step with Lens.</h2>\n     <p data-block-key=\"8ddvq\">Stuck on a tricky step or want to double-check your work? In the coming weeks, Lens in Search will offer a new interactive learning experience that helps you break down tough concepts and confirm if you’re on the right track. Just tap the Lens camera icon in the Google app (<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.google.android.googlequicksearchbox&amp;hl=en_US&amp;pli=1\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Android</a> and <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/google/id284815942\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">iOS</a>) and snap a photo of what you’re working on. You'll get an AI Overview that provides helpful explanations, pinpoints where you may have made mistakes, and coaches you when you’re stumped on a problem.</p>\n    </div>\n    <!---->\n   </uni-article-paragraph>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-inline-image-section\" data-component=\"uni-inline-image\">\n   <uni-inline-image class=\"uni-inline-image uni-inline-image--full\" alignment=\"full\" alt-text=\"Checking math work with Google lens\" external-image=\"\" or-mp4-video-title=\"Check My Work\" or-mp4-video-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/Check_My_Work.mp4\" section-header=\"5 new ways to level up your learning with Search\" autoplay=\"true\">\n    <!---->\n    <div class=\"uni-inline-image__container uni-inline-image__container--full \" data-analytics-module=\"{&quot;module_name&quot;:&quot;Inline Images&quot;,&quot;section_header&quot;:&quot;5 new ways to level up your learning with Search&quot;}\">\n     <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n     <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n     <div class=\" uni-inline-image__media-asset uni-inline-image__media-asset--mp4 \">\n      <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n      <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n      <uni-video-player muted playsinline=\"\" controls=\"\" type=\"video/mp4\" alt-text=\"Checking math work with Google lens\" autoplay=\"\" video-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/Check_My_Work.mp4\" tts-json=\"\" audio-descripted-video=\"\" section-header=\"5 new ways to level up your learning with Search\" video-title=\"Check My Work\">\n       <!---->\n       <div class=\"uni-video-player\">\n        <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n        <video crossorigin=\"anonymous\" preload=\"auto\" muted playsinline=\"\" aria-label=\"Checking math work with Google lens\" class=\" uni-video-player__video uni-video-player__video--autoplay \" title=\"Check My Work\" style=\"min-height:0px;\" autoplay=\"\" loop=\"\" poster=\"\">\n         <source type=\"video/mp4\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/Check_My_Work.mp4#t=0.001\">Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos, but don't worry, you can <a download=\"\" href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/Check_My_Work.mp4\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">download it</a> and watch it with your favorite video player!\n        </video>\n        <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n       </div>\n      </uni-video-player>\n      <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n      <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n      <!--?-->\n      <!--?-->\n      <!--?-->\n     </div>\n     <!--?-->\n     <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n    </div>\n   </uni-inline-image>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-article-paragraph\" data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Paragraph&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;5 new ways to level up your learning with Search&quot;\n  }\">\n   <uni-article-paragraph class=\"uni-article-paragraph__container uni-grid__col--layout-6\">\n    <div class=\"rich-text\">\n     <p data-block-key=\"tn5vb\">Need extra clarification? Ask a follow-up question and keep the conversation going in AI Mode, while you explore relevant sites on the web. This new experience with Lens will roll out globally in English over the coming weeks.</p>\n     <h2 data-block-key=\"1av0u\">4. Stay organized with notebooks.</h2>\n     <p data-block-key=\"eb200\"><a href=\"https://notebook.google.com/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Gemini Notebook</a> (formerly NotebookLM) is one of our most popular tools for learning, and this week, we’re bringing <a href=\"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/products/gemini-notebook/notebooklm-gemini-notebook/\">notebooks</a> to AI Mode — giving you an easy way to organize your studies and quickly find insights right in Search. You can set up a dedicated notebook for each class or project and add a range of sources like class slides, syllabi, or relevant web articles. You can even add your previous AI Mode threads on related topics. Your notebook brings it all together in one place, letting you ask questions and analyze topics based on your reference materials, while you build on your ideas over time.</p>\n    </div>\n    <!---->\n   </uni-article-paragraph>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-inline-image-section\" data-component=\"uni-inline-image\">\n   <uni-inline-image class=\"uni-inline-image uni-inline-image--full\" alignment=\"full\" alt-text=\"Example notebook\" external-image=\"\" or-mp4-video-title=\"Notebooks EnviroScience\" or-mp4-video-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/Notebooks_EnviroScience.mp4\" section-header=\"5 new ways to level up your learning with Search\" autoplay=\"true\">\n    <!---->\n    <div class=\"uni-inline-image__container uni-inline-image__container--full \" data-analytics-module=\"{&quot;module_name&quot;:&quot;Inline Images&quot;,&quot;section_header&quot;:&quot;5 new ways to level up your learning with Search&quot;}\">\n     <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n     <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n     <div class=\" uni-inline-image__media-asset uni-inline-image__media-asset--mp4 \">\n      <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n      <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n      <uni-video-player muted playsinline=\"\" controls=\"\" type=\"video/mp4\" alt-text=\"Example notebook\" autoplay=\"\" video-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/Notebooks_EnviroScience.mp4\" tts-json=\"\" audio-descripted-video=\"\" section-header=\"5 new ways to level up your learning with Search\" video-title=\"Notebooks EnviroScience\">\n       <!---->\n       <div class=\"uni-video-player\">\n        <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n        <video crossorigin=\"anonymous\" preload=\"auto\" muted playsinline=\"\" aria-label=\"Example notebook\" class=\" uni-video-player__video uni-video-player__video--autoplay \" title=\"Notebooks EnviroScience\" style=\"min-height:0px;\" autoplay=\"\" loop=\"\" poster=\"\">\n         <source type=\"video/mp4\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/Notebooks_EnviroScience.mp4#t=0.001\">Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos, but don't worry, you can <a download=\"\" href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/Notebooks_EnviroScience.mp4\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">download it</a> and watch it with your favorite video player!\n        </video>\n        <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n       </div>\n      </uni-video-player>\n      <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n      <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n      <!--?-->\n      <!--?-->\n      <!--?-->\n     </div>\n     <!--?-->\n     <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n    </div>\n   </uni-inline-image>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-article-paragraph\" data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Paragraph&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;5 new ways to level up your learning with Search&quot;\n  }\">\n   <uni-article-paragraph class=\"uni-article-paragraph__container uni-grid__col--layout-6\">\n    <div class=\"rich-text\">\n     <p data-block-key=\"tn5vb\">Your existing notebooks from <a href=\"https://notebook.google.com/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Gemini Notebook</a> or the <a href=\"http://gemini.google.com/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Gemini app</a> will <a href=\"https://support.google.com/gemininotebook/answer/17513891\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">appear automatically in Search</a>, syncing the sources and instructions for each notebook across Google products. Notebooks in AI Mode are rolling out over the coming days across more than 180 countries in English, with local language support to follow in the weeks ahead. <a class=\"superscript\" data-ga4-analytics-superscript-click=\"\" data-target=\"inline text\" href=\"#footnote-1\" id=\"footnote-source-1\" aria-label=\"Jump to link reference 1\"> <sup>1</sup> </a></p>\n     <h2 data-block-key=\"3qe6c\">5. Create custom files to streamline your studies.</h2>\n     <p data-block-key=\"4idbf\">Instead of manually copying and pasting scattered course materials, you can now ask Search to create ready-to-use study documents based on your uploaded files or AI Mode threads. For example, you can add a photo of your handwritten notes along with lecture slides and ask Search for a one-pager that outlines the key concepts.</p>\n    </div>\n    <!---->\n   </uni-article-paragraph>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-inline-image-section\" data-component=\"uni-inline-image\">\n   <uni-inline-image class=\"uni-inline-image uni-inline-image--full\" alignment=\"full\" alt-text=\"Turning notes into a one page PDF\" external-image=\"\" or-mp4-video-title=\"File Generation\" or-mp4-video-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/EDU_BTS_FileGeneration_Blog_1920x1080.mp4\" section-header=\"5 new ways to level up your learning with Search\" autoplay=\"true\">\n    <!---->\n    <div class=\"uni-inline-image__container uni-inline-image__container--full \" data-analytics-module=\"{&quot;module_name&quot;:&quot;Inline Images&quot;,&quot;section_header&quot;:&quot;5 new ways to level up your learning with Search&quot;}\">\n     <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n     <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n     <div class=\" uni-inline-image__media-asset uni-inline-image__media-asset--mp4 \">\n      <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n      <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n      <uni-video-player muted playsinline=\"\" controls=\"\" type=\"video/mp4\" alt-text=\"Turning notes into a one page PDF\" autoplay=\"\" video-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/EDU_BTS_FileGeneration_Blog_1920x1080.mp4\" tts-json=\"\" audio-descripted-video=\"\" section-header=\"5 new ways to level up your learning with Search\" video-title=\"File Generation\">\n       <!---->\n       <div class=\"uni-video-player\">\n        <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n        <video crossorigin=\"anonymous\" preload=\"auto\" muted playsinline=\"\" aria-label=\"Turning notes into a one page PDF\" class=\" uni-video-player__video uni-video-player__video--autoplay \" title=\"File Generation\" style=\"min-height:0px;\" autoplay=\"\" loop=\"\" poster=\"\">\n         <source type=\"video/mp4\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/EDU_BTS_FileGeneration_Blog_1920x1080.mp4#t=0.001\">Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos, but don't worry, you can <a download=\"\" href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/EDU_BTS_FileGeneration_Blog_1920x1080.mp4\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">download it</a> and watch it with your favorite video player!\n        </video>\n        <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n       </div>\n      </uni-video-player>\n      <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n      <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n      <!--?-->\n      <!--?-->\n      <!--?-->\n     </div>\n     <!--?-->\n     <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n    </div>\n   </uni-inline-image>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-article-paragraph\" data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Paragraph&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;5 new ways to level up your learning with Search&quot;\n  }\">\n   <uni-article-paragraph class=\"uni-article-paragraph__container uni-grid__col--layout-6\">\n    <div class=\"rich-text\">\n     <p data-block-key=\"tn5vb\">Custom file creation in AI Mode has rolled out globally in English and will come soon as well to AI Overviews. To start, it will be available for documents, slide presentations, spreadsheets, and text files across <a href=\"https://support.google.com/websearch/answer/17586477\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">a range of formats</a>, with more to come.</p>\n     <p data-block-key=\"7kbpf\">We hope these new tools help you learn with confidence this school year.</p>\n    </div>\n    <!---->\n   </uni-article-paragraph>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page\">\n   <uni-related-content-tout class=\"uni-related-content-tout uni-grid uni-component-spacing\" title=\"Back to School 2026\" cta=\"See more\" summary=\"How Google tools can help students and educators this back-to-school season.\" hideimage=\"False\" eyebrow=\"Collection\" image-alt-text=\"\" fullurl=\"https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/education/back-to-school-2026/\" pagetype=\"collectiondetailpage\" imageurl=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/BTSBundleCollection_social.width-800.format-webp.webp\" data-analytics-module=\"{\n      &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Related Content Tout&quot;,\n      &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Back to School 2026&quot;\n    }\" data-theme-color=\"neutral\">\n    <!---->\n    <section class=\"uni-related-content-tout uni-related-content-tout__container uni-grid__col--span-4 uni-grid__col--span-12-tablet uni-grid__col--start-1-tablet uni-grid__col--span-8-desktop uni-grid__col--start-3-desktop\" role=\"group\" aria-labelledby=\"tout-title\">\n     <div class=\"uni-related-content-tout__content\">\n      <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n      <p class=\"uni-related-content-tout__eyebrow font-eyebrow\"><!--?lit$1383547183$-->Collection</p>\n      <h2 id=\"tout-title\" class=\"uni-related-content-tout__title font-h4\"><!--?lit$1383547183$-->Back to School 2026</h2>\n      <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n      <div class=\"uni-related-content-tout__summary font-body-s\">\n       <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n       How Google tools can help students and educators this back-to-school season.\n      </div>\n      <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n      <div class=\"uni-related-content-tout__cta-container\">\n       <uni-cta emphasis=\"low\" icon-id-right=\"arrow-forward\" role=\"presentation\"><!----><a role=\"button\" aria-label=\"See more\" href=\"https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/education/back-to-school-2026/\" class=\"uni-cta  uni-cta--low-emphasis \"><!--?lit$1383547183$--><!--?lit$1383547183$--> <!--?lit$1383547183$--><span class=\" font-ctas uni-cta__label uni-cta__label--r-spacer \"><!--?lit$1383547183$--><!----><!--?lit$1383547183$--><!----><!---->See more<!----></span> <!--?lit$1383547183$--> \n         <div class=\"uni-cta__icon-container\">\n          <uni-icon-component custom-class=\"uni-cta__icon\" icon-id=\"arrow-forward\"><!----></uni-icon-component>\n         </div> \n         <!--?--></a></uni-cta>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"uni-related-content-tout__image-container\">\n      <!--?lit$1383547183$-->\n      <img class=\"uni-related-content-tout__image\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/BTSBundleCollection_social.width-800.format-webp.webp\" alt=\"Back to School 2026\">\n     </div>\n    </section>\n   </uni-related-content-tout>\n  </section>\n  <uni-portal portal-id=\"article-newsletter-portal\"></uni-portal>\n </body>\n</html>",
